  "worked_solution": "The terms of the expression are $4z,$ $-2v,$  and $-w.$ Looking at each term individually, we see that\n\n- the coefficient of the term $4z$ is $4$,\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-2v$ is $-2$, and\n\n- the coefficient of the term $-w$ is $-1.$\n\nSo, the coefficients of $z$ and $w$ of the given expression are $4$ and $-1,$ respectively.",
